<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow prose">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>This website collects only what you send us through a form: your name, how to reach you, and your message. On the Juniors form, a parent or guardian sends their own details and only the age of their child. We use what you send to answer you.</p>
    <p>Form submissions pass through a form-handling service on their way to our inboxes. We do not sell or share your information.</p>

    <h2>Tracking</h2>
    <p>The site has no ads and no tracking cookies.{% if site.analytics.plausibleDomain %} We count visits using Plausible, a privacy-friendly service that does not use cookies or collect personal data.{% else %} We do not currently run analytics.{% endif %}</p>

    <h2>Other services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Maps:</strong> the embedded map comes from OpenStreetMap.</li>
      <li><strong>Video:</strong> videos load from YouTube only after you press play.</li>
      <li><strong>Donations:</strong> when you donate online, you go to PayPal, which has its own privacy policy.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Photos</h2>
    <p>We show a member in a photo only with their signed consent. We show a minor only with a parent or guardian's consent. We do not post photos of victims or the addresses of incidents. If you'd like a photo of you or your family taken down, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> and we will remove it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
